  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4c4fcc29299e0dd4b9ba5cfd68e28c5b, type: 2}
  questLine:
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5c1ab1fafa323bd469319b7535534bc8, type: 2}
    text: I led seven into those woods. I'll not lose the ones who came back. Give me the Leader's work and raise a banner where everyone can see it.
    acceptText: A banner.
    waitingText: The Haven Banner, where all of us can see it.
    askText: 
    thanksText: 
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ebf2e33146efeff4e9095b88c2fcb5ae, type: 2}
    text: Seven went in. Ask them what they remember of the woods, each of them. I need to know what I'm not being told.
    acceptText: I'll ask.
    waitingText: Ingrid, Bjarne, Tor, Liv, Eirik and Runa. Ask each of them.
    askText: 
    thanksText: 
  questLineDone: 
